    <briefdescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="class_sum_collector" kindref="compound">SumCollector</ref></computeroutput> adapter that funnels engine-side <computeroutput><ref refid="unionring__elem" kindref="compound">ring_elem</ref></computeroutput> adds into a <computeroutput><ref refid="class_free_algebra_heap" kindref="compound">FreeAlgebraHeap</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Used wherever the engine&apos;s generic <computeroutput><ref refid="class_sum_collector" kindref="compound">SumCollector</ref></computeroutput> interface (e.g. for <computeroutput><ref refid="class_ring_map" kindref="compound">RingMap</ref></computeroutput> evaluation) needs to accumulate free-associative polynomials: each <computeroutput><ref refid="class_sum_collector_free_algebra_heap_ab4f592bdf66b68982215b9b7a26b4fcf_1ab4f592bdf66b68982215b9b7a26b4fcf" kindref="member">add(ring_elem f1)</ref></computeroutput> casts down to <computeroutput>Poly*</computeroutput> and pushes through to <computeroutput><ref refid="class_free_algebra_heap_ad203156874f08a6d875981c9ce4170cf_1ad203156874f08a6d875981c9ce4170cf" kindref="member">FreeAlgebraHeap::add</ref></computeroutput>, and <computeroutput><ref refid="class_sum_collector_free_algebra_heap_af31b1142fb3e4403265eb1664e465b8e_1af31b1142fb3e4403265eb1664e465b8e" kindref="member">getValue()</ref></computeroutput> returns the linearised sum as a fresh <computeroutput><ref refid="unionring__elem" kindref="compound">ring_elem</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
